 feature that would cause existing functionality to not work as expected)\r\n- [ ] Refactor (non-breaking change that only restructures code)\r\n- [x] Tests (You added tests for code that already exists, or your new feature included in this PR)\r\n- [ ] Documentation Updates\r\n- [ ] Release\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n## Before / After\r\nIf relevant, use this section for an English description of the change at a technical level.\r\nIf this change affects an API, examples should be included here.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n## Test Plan\r\nIf helpful, please describe the tests that you ran to verify your changes and provide instructions so that others can reproduce.\r\nThis section may not be needed if your change includes thoroughly commented unit tests.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n## Future Tasks\r\nFor future tasks related to PR.\r\n-->\r\n\n\n---\n- To see the specific tasks where the Asana app for GitHub is being used, see below:\n  - https://app.asana.com/0/0/1203706294512476","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/XRPLF/rippled/issues/4346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/XRPLF/rippled/issues/4346/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/XRPLF/rippled/issues/4101","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/XRPLF/rippled","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/XRPLF/rippled/issues/4101/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/XRPLF/rippled/issues/4101/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/XRPLF/rippled/issues/4101/events","html_url":"https://github.com/XRPLF/rippled/pull/4101","id":1138121281,"node_id":"PR_kwDOACmRR84y1C9M","number":4101,"title":"Introduce NFT support (XLS-20)","user":{"login":"scottschurr","id":7840379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NDAzNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7840379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https